{"id":"db9c3028662cd4b5","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NAx.md","title":"NAx","display":"NAx","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NAx","parameters":["r","t","u"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NAx"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>r</span><span>t</span><span>u</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命名项与开放等式。有序参数：<code>r</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NAx r t u)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ NMode r)\n  (and\n    (@ NRaw t)\n    (and\n      (@ NRaw u)\n      (or\n        (@ NAlpha t u)\n        (or\n          (exists x\n            (exists b\n              (exists s\n                (exists l (and (or (@ Num1 r) (@ Num2 r)) (and (@ NLam x b l) (and (@ NApp l s t) (@ NSub x s b u))))))))\n          (exists x\n            (exists b\n              (exists vx\n                (and (@ Num2 r) (and (@ NVar x vx) (and (@ NApp u vx b) (and (@ NLam x b t) (not (@ NFree x u))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e530de2f67510985\" href=\"?note=e530de2f67510985\" title=\"ZFC_NAlpha\">NAlpha</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cff538dd049d418\" href=\"?note=3cff538dd049d418\" title=\"ZFC_NApp\">NApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d7a1e6d5f52b38db\" href=\"?note=d7a1e6d5f52b38db\" title=\"ZFC_NFree\">NFree</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d7c6583016ee6af4\" href=\"?note=d7c6583016ee6af4\" title=\"ZFC_NLam\">NLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e430f284172300e\" href=\"?note=2e430f284172300e\" title=\"ZFC_NMode\">NMode</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5ba5bcae5363217b\" href=\"?note=5ba5bcae5363217b\" title=\"ZFC_NRaw\">NRaw</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c2eed29b5aacecb\" href=\"?note=9c2eed29b5aacecb\" title=\"ZFC_NSub\">NSub</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" href=\"?note=fa2c5e1cba7142c3\" title=\"ZFC_NVar\">NVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NAx r t u)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NAlpha","status":"resolved","id":"e530de2f67510985","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_NAlpha|NAlpha]]；[[ZFC_NApp|NApp]]；[[ZFC_NFree|NFree]]；[[ZFC_NLam|NLam]]；[[ZFC_NMode|NMode]]；[[ZFC_NRaw|NRaw]]；[[ZFC_NSub|NSub]]；[[ZFC_NVar|NVar]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NApp","status":"resolved","id":"3cff538dd049d418","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_NAlpha|NAlp